<title>USA: FINAL PRICING - State of Washington.</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING - State of Washington.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>SeaFirst Bank said it received the written award for $27.175 million of State of Washington, certificates of participation with a top yield of 5.40 percent in 2008.</p>
